extends layout.pug

block content

  nav.nav
    a(href='/')
      span &larr;
      |  Back
      
  article.portfolio-intro


    h1 Future projects


    p As I continue my Full Stack JavaScript Techdegree journey, my upcoming projects will focus on expanding my knowledge of modern web development and software engineering practices.
    p Future work will include building applications with React, working with SQL databases, and designing and consuming REST APIs. These projects will allow me to strengthen my understanding of both frontend and backend development while gaining experience with data management and application architecture.
    p Looking ahead, I also plan to continue exploring automation, testing, and DevOps-related technologies to broaden my technical skill set. My goal is to build reliable, scalable applications while continuously growing as a well-rounded technical professional.




  article.portfolio-project-thumbs
    .projects-box.box.grid

      each project in projects

        .cell
          a(href=`/projects/${project.id}`)
            img.thumbnail(src=`${project.image_urls[0]}`, alt='Photo of the project in desktop screen')
            if project.status_tag
              span.project-status-tag.project-status-tag--card= project.status_tag
            h5= project.project_name